[{"id":"anfaqa-8-3-5","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"udjeljuju","en":"they spend"},{"bs":"udjeljujte!","en":"spend!"},{"bs":"potrošio je","en":"he/it spent"},{"bs":"trošite","en":"you (all) spend"}],"ref":"8:3","answerWord":"يُنفِقُونَ","answerSound":"audio/32278464cabe85098cf8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who establish worship and spend of that We have bestowed on them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يُقِيمُونَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَمِمَّا","رَزَقْنَٰهُمْ","يُنفِقُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-25-67-2","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"troše","en":"they spend"},{"bs":"potrošio si","en":"you spent"},{"bs":"neka udijeli","en":"let him spend"},{"bs":"potrošili ste","en":"you (all) spent"}],"ref":"25:67","answerWord":"أَنفَقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/1df2bee7433ca84b4ca4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who, when they spend, are neither prodigal nor grudging; and there is ever a firm station between the two;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَآ","أَنفَقُوا۟","لَمْ","يُسْرِفُوا۟","وَلَمْ","يَقْتُرُوا۟","وَكَانَ","بَيْنَ","ذَٰلِكَ","قَوَامًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-2-195-0","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i potrošite!","en":"and (you all) spend!"},{"bs":"troše","en":"they spend"},{"bs":"potrošili ste","en":"you (all) spent"},{"bs":"i troše","en":"and they spend"}],"ref":"2:195","answerWord":"وَأَنفِقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/10be62f69a72b65c1251.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Spend your wealth for the cause of Allah, and be not cast by your own hands to ruin; and do good. Lo! Allah loveth the beneficent.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["وَأَنفِقُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلَا","تُلْقُوا۟","بِأَيْدِيكُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلتَّهْلُكَةِ","وَأَحْسِنُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-9-53-1","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"udjeljujte!","en":"spend!"},{"bs":"troši","en":"he/it spends"},{"bs":"potrošili ste","en":"you (all) spent"},{"bs":"trošite","en":"you (all) spend"}],"ref":"9:53","answerWord":"أَنفِقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a9c122fba7761f829971.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Pay (your contribution), willingly or unwillingly, it will not be accepted from you. Lo! ye were ever froward folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَنفِقُوا۟","طَوْعًا","أَوْ","كَرْهًا","لَّن","يُتَقَبَّلَ","مِنكُمْ","إِنَّكُمْ","كُنتُمْ","قَوْمًا","فَٰسِقِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-4-39-7","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i potrošili su","en":"and they spent"},{"bs":"potrošio je","en":"he/it spent"},{"bs":"i troše","en":"and they spend"},{"bs":"i potrošite!","en":"and (you all) spend!"}],"ref":"4:39","answerWord":"وَأَنفَقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/f49973e0f350dd6c869d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"What have they (to fear) if they believe in Allah and the Last Day and spend (aright) of that which Allah hath bestowed upon them, when Allah is ever Aware of them (and all they do)?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["وَمَاذَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","لَوْ","ءَامَنُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","وَأَنفَقُوا۟","مِمَّا","رَزَقَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِهِمْ","عَلِيمًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-2-215-5","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"potrošili ste","en":"you (all) spent"},{"bs":"udjeljujte!","en":"spend!"},{"bs":"neka udijeli","en":"let him spend"},{"bs":"potrošio si","en":"you spent"}],"ref":"2:215","answerWord":"أَنفَقْتُم","answerSound":"audio/e920d50785bde0763ffe.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They ask thee, (O Muhammad), what they shall spend. Say: that which ye spend for good (must go) to parents and near kindred and orphans and the needy and the wayfarer. And whatsoever good ye do, lo! Allah is Aware of it.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","مَاذَا","يُنفِقُونَ","قُلْ","مَآ","أَنفَقْتُم","مِّنْ","خَيْرٍ","فَلِلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ","وَٱلْأَقْرَبِينَ","وَٱلْيَتَٰمَىٰ","وَٱلْمَسَٰكِينِ","وَٱبْنِ","ٱلسَّبِيلِ","وَمَا","تَفْعَلُوا۟","مِنْ","خَيْرٍ","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","بِهِۦ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-2-267-17","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"trošite","en":"you (all) spend"},{"bs":"i troše","en":"and they spend"},{"bs":"potrošio je","en":"he/it spent"},{"bs":"pa potrošite!","en":"so (you all) spend!"}],"ref":"2:267","answerWord":"تُنفِقُونَ","answerSound":"audio/3a969968e056e69dc63d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Spend of the good things which ye have earned, and of that which We bring forth from the earth for you, and seek not the bad (with intent) to spend thereof (in charity) when ye would not take it for yourselves save with disdain; and know that Allah is Absolute, Owner of Praise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","أَنفِقُوا۟","مِن","طَيِّبَٰتِ","مَا","كَسَبْتُمْ","وَمِمَّآ","أَخْرَجْنَا","لَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَلَا","تَيَمَّمُوا۟","ٱلْخَبِيثَ","مِنْهُ","تُنفِقُونَ","وَلَسْتُم","بِـَٔاخِذِيهِ","إِلَّآ","أَن","تُغْمِضُوا۟","فِيهِ","وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","أَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَنِىٌّ","حَمِيدٌ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-18-42-7","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"potrošio je","en":"he/it spent"},{"bs":"troše ih","en":"they spend them"},{"bs":"neka udijeli","en":"let him spend"},{"bs":"i troše","en":"and they spend"}],"ref":"18:42","answerWord":"أَنفَقَ","answerSound":"audio/b531b7a27eb415b51d34.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And his fruit was beset (with destruction). Then began he to wring his hands for all that he had spent upon it, when (now) it was all ruined on its trellises, and to say: Would that I had ascribed no partner to my Lord!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["وَأُحِيطَ","بِثَمَرِهِۦ","فَأَصْبَحَ","يُقَلِّبُ","كَفَّيْهِ","عَلَىٰ","مَآ","أَنفَقَ","فِيهَا","وَهِىَ","خَاوِيَةٌ","عَلَىٰ","عُرُوشِهَا","وَيَقُولُ","يَٰلَيْتَنِى","لَمْ","أُشْرِكْ","بِرَبِّىٓ","أَحَدًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-8-36-9","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa će ih potrošiti","en":"so they will spend them"},{"bs":"potrošio si","en":"you spent"},{"bs":"udjeljuju","en":"they spend"},{"bs":"i potrošite!","en":"and (you all) spend!"}],"ref":"8:36","answerWord":"فَسَيُنفِقُونَهَا","answerSound":"audio/a50a81c1ddf693c70e8e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who disbelieve spend their wealth in order that they may debar (men) from the way of Allah. They will spend it, then it will become an anguish for them, then they will be conquered. And those who disbelieve will be gathered unto hell,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","يُنفِقُونَ","أَمْوَٰلَهُمْ","لِيَصُدُّوا۟","عَن","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَسَيُنفِقُونَهَا","ثُمَّ","تَكُونُ","عَلَيْهِمْ","حَسْرَةً","ثُمَّ","يُغْلَبُونَ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰ","جَهَنَّمَ","يُحْشَرُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-8-63-4","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"potrošio si","en":"you spent"},{"bs":"da udijelite","en":"so that you (all) may spend"},{"bs":"potrošili ste","en":"you (all) spent"},{"bs":"pa će ih potrošiti","en":"so they will spend them"}],"ref":"8:63","answerWord":"أَنفَقْتَ","answerSound":"audio/7f8e71af55395796d4c8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (as for the believers) hath attuned their hearts. If thou hadst spent all that is in the earth thou couldst not have attuned their hearts, but Allah hath attuned them. Lo! He is Mighty, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["وَأَلَّفَ","بَيْنَ","قُلُوبِهِمْ","لَوْ","أَنفَقْتَ","مَا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","جَمِيعًا","مَّآ","أَلَّفْتَ","بَيْنَ","قُلُوبِهِمْ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","أَلَّفَ","بَيْنَهُمْ","إِنَّهُۥ","عَزِيزٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-9-34-21","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"troše ih","en":"they spend them"},{"bs":"troše","en":"they spend"},{"bs":"pa potrošite!","en":"so (you all) spend!"},{"bs":"trošite","en":"you (all) spend"}],"ref":"9:34","answerWord":"يُنفِقُونَهَا","answerSound":"audio/f23c748380d0357803c7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Lo! many of the (Jewish) rabbis and the (Christian) monks devour the wealth of mankind wantonly and debar (men) from the way of Allah. They who hoard up gold and silver and spend it not in the way of Allah, unto them give tidings (O Muhammad) of a painful doom,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","كَثِيرًا","مِّنَ","ٱلْأَحْبَارِ","وَٱلرُّهْبَانِ","لَيَأْكُلُونَ","أَمْوَٰلَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","بِٱلْبَٰطِلِ","وَيَصُدُّونَ","عَن","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","يَكْنِزُونَ","ٱلذَّهَبَ","وَٱلْفِضَّةَ","وَلَا","يُنفِقُونَهَا","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَبَشِّرْهُم","بِعَذَابٍ","أَلِيمٍ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-14-31-6","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i troše","en":"and they spend"},{"bs":"potrošili ste","en":"you (all) spent"},{"bs":"potrošio si","en":"you spent"},{"bs":"i potrošite!","en":"and (you all) spend!"}],"ref":"14:31","answerWord":"وَيُنفِقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a232c2ba259025f3556d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Tell My bondmen who believe to establish worship and spend of that which We have given them, secretly and publicly, before a day cometh wherein there will be neither traffick nor befriending.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["قُل","لِّعِبَادِىَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","يُقِيمُوا۟","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَيُنفِقُوا۟","مِمَّا","رَزَقْنَٰهُمْ","سِرًّا","وَعَلَانِيَةً","مِّن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يَأْتِىَ","يَوْمٌ","لَّا","بَيْعٌ","فِيهِ","وَلَا","خِلَٰلٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-47-38-3","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"da udijelite","en":"so that you (all) may spend"},{"bs":"i troše","en":"and they spend"},{"bs":"i potrošite!","en":"and (you all) spend!"},{"bs":"potrošio je","en":"he/it spent"}],"ref":"47:38","answerWord":"لِتُنفِقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/d7540166e4de3adc2d85.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! ye are those who are called to spend in the way of Allah, yet among you there are some who hoard. And as for him who hoardeth, he hoardeth only from his soul. And Allah is the Rich, and ye are the poor. And if ye turn away He will exchange you for some other folk, and they will not be the likes of you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["هَٰٓأَنتُمْ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","تُدْعَوْنَ","لِتُنفِقُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَمِنكُم","مَّن","يَبْخَلُ","وَمَن","يَبْخَلْ","فَإِنَّمَا","يَبْخَلُ","عَن","نَّفْسِهِۦ","وَٱللَّهُ","ٱلْغَنِىُّ","وَأَنتُمُ","ٱلْفُقَرَآءُ","وَإِن","تَتَوَلَّوْا۟","يَسْتَبْدِلْ","قَوْمًا","غَيْرَكُمْ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يَكُونُوٓا۟","أَمْثَٰلَكُم"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-65-7-0","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"neka udijeli","en":"let him spend"},{"bs":"troše ih","en":"they spend them"},{"bs":"potrošili ste","en":"you (all) spent"},{"bs":"potrošio si","en":"you spent"}],"ref":"65:7","answerWord":"لِيُنفِقْ","answerSound":"audio/1e7872c563e465094406.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Let him who hath abundance spend of his abundance, and he whose provision is measured, let him spend of that which Allah hath given him. Allah asketh naught of any soul save that which He hath given it. Allah will vouchsafe, after hardship, ease.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["لِيُنفِقْ","ذُو","سَعَةٍ","مِّن","سَعَتِهِۦ","وَمَن","قُدِرَ","عَلَيْهِ","رِزْقُهُۥ","فَلْيُنفِقْ","مِمَّآ","ءَاتَىٰهُ","ٱللَّهُ","لَا","يُكَلِّفُ","ٱللَّهُ","نَفْسًا","إِلَّا","مَآ","ءَاتَىٰهَا","سَيَجْعَلُ","ٱللَّهُ","بَعْدَ","عُسْرٍ","يُسْرًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"anfaqa-65-7-9","words":["verb:anfaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa neka udijeli","en":"so let him spend"},{"bs":"troše ih","en":"they spend them"},{"bs":"udjeljujte!","en":"spend!"},{"bs":"da udijelite","en":"so that you (all) may spend"}],"ref":"65:7","answerWord":"فَلْيُنفِقْ","answerSound":"audio/f45f99abe848497eab4f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Let him who hath abundance spend of his abundance, and he whose provision is measured, let him spend of that which Allah hath given him. Allah asketh naught of any soul save that which He hath given it. Allah will vouchsafe, after hardship, ease.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trošiti, udijeliti","en":"to spend"},"passage":["لِيُنفِقْ","ذُو","سَعَةٍ","مِّن","سَعَتِهِۦ","وَمَن","قُدِرَ","عَلَيْهِ","رِزْقُهُۥ","فَلْيُنفِقْ","مِمَّآ","ءَاتَىٰهُ","ٱللَّهُ","لَا","يُكَلِّفُ","ٱللَّهُ","نَفْسًا","إِلَّا","مَآ","ءَاتَىٰهَا","سَيَجْعَلُ","ٱللَّهُ","بَعْدَ","عُسْرٍ","يُسْرًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَنفَقَ"}},{"id":"ayyada-2-87-13","words":["verb:ayyada"],"options":[{"bs":"i podržali smo ga","en":"and we supported him"},{"bs":"i podržao vas je","en":"and he/it supported you (all)"},{"bs":"podržao te je","en":"He supported you"},{"bs":"podržao sam te","en":"I supported you"}],"ref":"2:87","answerWord":"وَأَيَّدْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/ca1a00dc371e9362cc8c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily We gave unto Moses the Scripture and We caused a train of messengers to follow after him, and We gave unto Jesus, son of Mary, clear proofs (of Allah's sovereignty), and We supported him with the Holy spirit. Is it ever so, that, when there cometh unto you a messenger (from Allah) with that which ye yourselves desire not, ye grow arrogant, and some ye disbelieve and some ye slay?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podržati, ojačati","en":"to support"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","ءَاتَيْنَا","مُوسَى","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","وَقَفَّيْنَا","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِۦ","بِٱلرُّسُلِ","وَءَاتَيْنَا","عِيسَى","ٱبْنَ","مَرْيَمَ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَأَيَّدْنَٰهُ","بِرُوحِ","ٱلْقُدُسِ","أَفَكُلَّمَا","جَآءَكُمْ","رَسُولٌۢ","بِمَا","لَا","تَهْوَىٰٓ","أَنفُسُكُمُ","ٱسْتَكْبَرْتُمْ","فَفَرِيقًا","كَذَّبْتُمْ","وَفَرِيقًا","تَقْتُلُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَيَّدَ"}},{"id":"ayyada-3-13-19","words":["verb:ayyada"],"options":[{"bs":"podržava","en":"he/it supports"},{"bs":"i podržao ga je","en":"and he/it supported him"},{"bs":"podržao te je","en":"He supported you"},{"bs":"i podržao ih je","en":"and he/it supported them"}],"ref":"3:13","answerWord":"يُؤَيِّدُ","answerSound":"audio/be5677cb2b9fc913792d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There was a token for you in two hosts which met: one army fighting in the way of Allah, and another disbelieving, whom they saw as twice their number, clearly, with their very eyes. Thus Allah strengtheneth with His succour whom He will. Lo! herein verily is a lesson for those who have eyes.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podržati, ojačati","en":"to support"},"passage":["قَدْ","كَانَ","لَكُمْ","ءَايَةٌ","فِى","فِئَتَيْنِ","ٱلْتَقَتَا","فِئَةٌ","تُقَٰتِلُ","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَأُخْرَىٰ","كَافِرَةٌ","يَرَوْنَهُم","مِّثْلَيْهِمْ","رَأْىَ","ٱلْعَيْنِ","وَٱللَّهُ","يُؤَيِّدُ","بِنَصْرِهِۦ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَعِبْرَةً","لِّأُو۟لِى","ٱلْأَبْصَٰرِ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"أَيَّدَ"}},{"id":"ayyada-8-26-12","words":["verb:ayyada"],"options":[{"bs":"i podržao vas je","en":"and he/it supported you (all)"},{"bs":"i podržao ih je","en":"and he/it supported them"},{"bs":"i podržali smo ga","en":"and we supported him"},{"bs":"podržava","en":"he/it supports"}],"ref":"8:26","answerWord":"وَأَيَّدَكُم","answerSound":"audio/8644a6fcfe72973b9612.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And remember, when ye were few and reckoned feeble in the land, and were in fear lest men should extirpate you, how He gave you refuge, and strengthened you with His help, and made provision of good things for you, that haply ye might be thankful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podržati, ojačati","en":"to support"},"passage":["وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","إِذْ","أَنتُمْ","قَلِيلٌ","مُّسْتَضْعَفُونَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","تَخَافُونَ","أَن","يَتَخَطَّفَكُمُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","فَـَٔاوَىٰكُمْ","وَأَيَّدَكُم","بِنَصْرِهِۦ","وَرَزَقَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلطَّيِّبَٰتِ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَشْكُرُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"أَيَّدَ"}},{"id":"ayyada-8-62-9","words":["verb:ayyada"],"options":[{"bs":"podržao te je","en":"He supported you"},{"bs":"i podržao ga je","en":"and he/it supported him"},{"bs":"podržao sam te","en":"I supported you"},{"bs":"i podržao vas je","en":"and he/it supported you (all)"}],"ref":"8:62","answerWord":"أَيَّدَكَ","answerSound":"audio/695407eb7d5be55cd153.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if they would deceive thee, then lo! Allah is Sufficient for thee. He it is Who supporteth thee with His help and with the believers,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podržati, ojačati","en":"to support"},"passage":["وَإِن","يُرِيدُوٓا۟","أَن","يَخْدَعُوكَ","فَإِنَّ","حَسْبَكَ","ٱللَّهُ","هُوَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَيَّدَكَ","بِنَصْرِهِۦ","وَبِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَيَّدَ"}},{"id":"aghwa-7-16-2","words":["verb:aghwa"],"options":[{"bs":"zaveo si me","en":"you misled me"},{"bs":"pa smo vas zaveli","en":"so we led you astray"},{"bs":"zavodi vas","en":"he/it misleads you (all)"},{"bs":"zaveli smo","en":"we misled"}],"ref":"7:16","answerWord":"أَغْوَيْتَنِى","answerSound":"audio/6354542592d34c8b3319.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Now, because Thou hast sent me astray, verily I shall lurk in ambush for them on Thy Right Path.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavesti, odvesti u zabludu","en":"to mislead, to lead astray"},"passage":["قَالَ","فَبِمَآ","أَغْوَيْتَنِى","لَأَقْعُدَنَّ","لَهُمْ","صِرَٰطَكَ","ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْوَى"}},{"id":"aghwa-11-34-13","words":["verb:aghwa"],"options":[{"bs":"zavodi vas","en":"he/it misleads you (all)"},{"bs":"pa smo vas zaveli","en":"so we led you astray"},{"bs":"zaveo si me","en":"you misled me"},{"bs":"zaveli smo","en":"we misled"}],"ref":"11:34","answerWord":"يُغْوِيَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/62064ffeba6794619d4c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"My counsel will not profit you if I were minded to advise you, if Allah's will is to keep you astray. He is your Lord and unto Him ye will be brought back.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavesti, odvesti u zabludu","en":"to mislead, to lead astray"},"passage":["وَلَا","يَنفَعُكُمْ","نُصْحِىٓ","إِنْ","أَرَدتُّ","أَنْ","أَنصَحَ","لَكُمْ","إِن","كَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","يُرِيدُ","أَن","يُغْوِيَكُمْ","هُوَ","رَبُّكُمْ","وَإِلَيْهِ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْوَى"}},{"id":"aghwa-28-63-8","words":["verb:aghwa"],"options":[{"bs":"zaveli smo","en":"we misled"},{"bs":"zavodi vas","en":"he/it misleads you (all)"},{"bs":"zaveli smo ih","en":"we misled them"},{"bs":"sigurno ću ih zavesti","en":"I will surely lead them astray"}],"ref":"28:63","answerWord":"أَغْوَيْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/056e8e92585caa6b1667.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those concerning whom the Word will have come true will say: Our Lord! These are they whom we led astray. We led them astray even as we ourselves were astray. We declare our innocence before Thee: us they never worshipped.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavesti, odvesti u zabludu","en":"to mislead, to lead astray"},"passage":["قَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","حَقَّ","عَلَيْهِمُ","ٱلْقَوْلُ","رَبَّنَا","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَغْوَيْنَآ","أَغْوَيْنَٰهُمْ","كَمَا","غَوَيْنَا","تَبَرَّأْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","مَا","كَانُوٓا۟","إِيَّانَا","يَعْبُدُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْوَى"}},{"id":"aghwa-28-63-9","words":["verb:aghwa"],"options":[{"bs":"zaveli smo ih","en":"we misled them"},{"bs":"zaveli smo","en":"we misled"},{"bs":"sigurno ću ih zavesti","en":"I will surely lead them astray"},{"bs":"pa smo vas zaveli","en":"so we led you astray"}],"ref":"28:63","answerWord":"أَغْوَيْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/8a9d4180c6e7f84b9508.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those concerning whom the Word will have come true will say: Our Lord! These are they whom we led astray. We led them astray even as we ourselves were astray. We declare our innocence before Thee: us they never worshipped.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavesti, odvesti u zabludu","en":"to mislead, to lead astray"},"passage":["قَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","حَقَّ","عَلَيْهِمُ","ٱلْقَوْلُ","رَبَّنَا","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَغْوَيْنَآ","أَغْوَيْنَٰهُمْ","كَمَا","غَوَيْنَا","تَبَرَّأْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","مَا","كَانُوٓا۟","إِيَّانَا","يَعْبُدُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْوَى"}},{"id":"aghwa-37-32-0","words":["verb:aghwa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo vas zaveli","en":"so we led you astray"},{"bs":"zaveli smo ih","en":"we misled them"},{"bs":"sigurno ću ih zavesti","en":"I will surely lead them astray"},{"bs":"zaveo si me","en":"you misled me"}],"ref":"37:32","answerWord":"فَأَغْوَيْنَٰكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/aaddb8c83c56a2a093cb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus we misled you. Lo! we were (ourselves) astray.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavesti, odvesti u zabludu","en":"to mislead, to lead astray"},"passage":["فَأَغْوَيْنَٰكُمْ","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","غَٰوِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْوَى"}}]